  "body": "Refs #809 (Fable's Detail on LOT-189, handed to cloud/orch by mac/M1 on #368, 2026-11-12)\nClaim: cloud/orch\n\n**Problem.** LOT-189 (#809) added two settings keys, `icon_previous` and `icon_revert_asked`. The storage-tier table of ADR 0013 does not list them.\n\n**Change.** Two rows next to `icon`, both **Device-only**. This matches `SettingScopeTests` (`\"icon_previous\": .device, \"icon_revert_asked\": .device`) and the doc comments in `SettingKey.swift:71-76`. No decision changes: the ADR now records what the code and the tests already say.\n\n**Tests.** Docs only; `fold.py --check` ok. No ledger entry.\n\nADR change: merged by the core after a Fable 5.2 review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGTbJ8LjeZ6VYEWrtJ)_",
